<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 15/18.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 15/18.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Friday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for August 18. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   16.08.97	  15.08.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.3644	    6.3326</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1757	    2.1766</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.2760	    4.2772</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.3870	    3.4400</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.4990	    0.5003</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7263	    0.7263</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2719	    0.2723</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8219	    6.8370</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6880	    0.6885</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1463	    1.1494</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
